  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">La paz avanza con garant&#xed;as de los DDHH y el fortalecimiento de la democracia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be aimed at guaranteeing the fulfilment of the CCEEU&apos;s mandate to contribute to the defence and strengthening of the social rule of law: i) the promotion of tools for the enforceability of guarantees for human rights leaders and defenders; ii) progress in the formulation of public policies and mechanisms to guarantee human rights; iii) the generation of mechanisms to monitor the implementation of policies related to comprehensive protection and guarantees for social protest; Fight against impunity: (i) supporting and backing the Integral System of Truth, Justice, Reparation and Non-Repetition (SIVJRNR), a product of the Final Peace Agreement; (ii) the promotion of complementary initiatives that contribute to truth, justice and guarantees of non-repetition of HRDs violations and socio-political violence; iii) the visibilisation and analysis of territorial Human Rights issues; iv) Strengthen the visibilisation of women&apos;s Human Rights issues and those of the LGBT population in terms of impunity; Peacebuilding and negotiated solutions to the armed conflict: (i) develop effective mechanisms for monitoring the implementation of the Peace Agreement, with a comprehensive look at its impacts on HRDs; (ii) participate in mechanisms tending towards the search for political negotiation mechanisms for overcoming the armed conflict; (iii) promote the generation of humanitarian pacts or agreements in the regions; (iv) have an impact on guaranteeing the rights of victims.</narrative>
  </description>
